 "remarks": "Chic industrial NYC-style loft. Just 7-minutes from bustling downtown South Norwalk, this centrally-located building is bursting with amenities that include a parking garage, newly renovated gym, conference room and communal picnic space. Inside the loft, you're welcomed with gorgeous 2-story windows, warm natural lighting and a stunning brick feature wall that adds to the character-filled finishes throughout. The open concept entertainment space is perfect for hosting friends and family, white kitchen cabinetry, hardware, new dishwasher, & new sink & faucet. Just off the living room sits a charming home office, one of only two units in the building that offer this space - perfect for working from home. Half-bath is just off the kitchen, featuring updated wainscoting and lighting. The lofted bedroom is spacious and private with luxury vinyl flooring throughout. Closet organization system make the most of space, and the chic modern bathroom has been updated with new lighting, flooring, and additional cabinetry added for extra storage. Tenant in place and WFH, all appointments must be confirmed and require 24 hr notice. Once tenant moves the unit will be professionally cleaned.",
